#: /home/markus/InvenioRDM/safe/datasafe-rdm/site/datasafe_rdm/templates/semantic-ui/datasafe_rdm/about.html:32
msgid ""
"Welcome to datasafe, the University of Münster's research data archive. "
"With the help of\n"
"              datasafe, you can archive your research data non-publicly "
"for ten years on university servers free of\n"
"              charge. After this period, the data is usually deleted "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#: /home/markus/InvenioRDM/safe/datasafe-rdm/site/datasafe_rdm/templates/semantic-ui/datasafe_rdm/about.html:36
msgid ""
"datasafe supports you in meeting the requirements of the university and "
"third-party funding\n"
"              bodies such as the DFG, which demand the long-term storage "
"of research data as the basis for published\n"
"              results. The datasafe service is provided by the University"
" and State Library of Münster (ULB) and the\n"
"              Centre for Information Technology (CIT) of the University "
"of Münster."
msgstr ""

#: /home/markus/InvenioRDM/safe/datasafe-rdm/site/datasafe_rdm/templates/semantic-ui/datasafe_rdm/about.html:41
msgid ""
"Our repository is based on the InvenioRDM framework developed at the "
"European Organisation for\n"
"              Nuclear Research (CERN), which is also the basis for "
msgstr ""

#: /home/markus/InvenioRDM/safe/datasafe-rdm/site/datasafe_rdm/templates/semantic-ui/datasafe_rdm/about.html:44
msgid ""
". By participating in collaborative efforts to\n"
"              improve this framework, we contribute our expertise while "
"benefiting from the developments of the\n"
"              international community. In addition, we make local changes"
" and enhancements to the system to ensure that\n"
"              our repository is optimally adapted to the needs of the "
"users at the University of Münster."
msgstr ""

