"research data. Our repository offers a secure\n"
"              platform to store your research data for ten years. Do you "
"still have questions or need support in using\n"
"              our repository? Please take a look at our FAQ (<a "
"href='/faq'>link</a>) or contact us at <a href='mailto:forschungsdaten"
"@uni-muenster.de'>support@example.org</a>!"
